      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HELMSLEY (4) turned in a good run last time, finishing in the placings (26.16) at this track in a Grade 3/4. Lines up from box 4 for the first time. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Expected to feature in the finish again. KING HASS (7) won again in an impressive display to make it two on the bounce, scoring at this track over 461m (25.80). Winner at his latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Should be in this for a long way. FELTHAM (2) is a super consistent dog who rarely misses the frame, last start scoring at this track (19.33), making it three straight wins. Form at the trip sound including two wins. Has a good overall strike-rate and can find the frame here. SOCIALLY SLEEK (5) can find the frame without surprising.",
